<title>FRANCE: Refco's French subsidiary buys Grel brokerage.</title>
<headline>Refco's French subsidiary buys Grel brokerage.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Refco Marche Monetaire SA, a fully owned subsidiary of Refco Group Ltd, said on Thursday it had bought French interbank brokerage Grel SA.</p>
<p>Refco said in a statement the acquisition had the approval of the authorities and that Refco Marche Monetaire Managing Director Ivan Ljubic would be chairman of Grel.</p>
<p>The terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
</text>
